## ▶️ Installation

Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/Mainuddin123/Apple_Tomato-Classification.git
```

Move into the project folder:

```bash
cd Apple_Tomato-Classification
```

Install dependencies:

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

Run the application:

```bash
streamlit run app.py
```

